{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13253","headline":"送田济之扬州赴选 · 皇甫冉","name":"送田济之扬州赴选","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家贫不自给，求禄爲荒年。\n调补无高位，卑栖屈此贤。\n江山欲霜雪，吴楚接风烟。\n相去诚非远，离心亦渺然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13253.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13253","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}